  "difficulty_reason": "Beyond ordinary braid-fan and simplicial-fan realization prerequisites, the proof constructs a sweeping bijection and its exact linear-extension fibers, proves all rotation adjacency and edge-cut properties for four decoration types, and establishes the complete permutree fan. Explicit ancestor/descendant counts solve every edge-cut hyperplane and all16 rotation cases yield a positive adjacent vertex difference. This global deleted-inequality polytopal realization is beyond ordinary doctoral combinatorics qualifiers.",
